WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.760
THE KING'S ARMY HAS ENTERED
THE LOWER GATE!

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:07.792
No… they found the mark.

00:00:07.990 --> 00:00:09.646
GUYS! WE'RE OUT OF TIME!

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.372
WHY ARE THEY HUNTING ME?!

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:17.320
BECAUSE THE KING KNOWS
WHAT YOU CARRY!

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:21.776
This is an actual city?!

00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:25.644
Look at those walls!
This place is enormous!

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:28.856
Enjoy the view later!
THEY'RE STILL CHASING US!

00:00:30.500 --> 00:00:32.468
THERE! THE FOUR STRANGERS!

00:00:40.500 --> 00:00:43.068
Get down! Everyone's kneeling!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:44.532
WHY?!

00:00:45.500 --> 00:00:47.516
BECAUSE THAT'S
THE KING'S PROCESSION!

00:00:48.000 --> 00:00:50.280
Guys… that cart!

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.468
You want us to steal
a donkey cart?!

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.160
I WANT US TO SURVIVE!

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.752
SOMEBODY GRAB ME!

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.448
THERE ARE SOLDIERS
ON HORSEBACK!

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:02.208
WHAT ARE YOU DOING
ON MY CART?!

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.320
WE'RE BORROWING IT!

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:06.224
GET OFF MY CART!

00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:13.096
This symbol…
I've seen it before.

00:01:13.500 --> 00:01:14.316
Where?

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:16.680
On the warrior's tablet.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:18.584
Then this must be the place.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:21.040
THE MARKED ONE! SEIZE HIM!

00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.020
We're looking for something
about the four strangers.

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:26.276
There must be thousands
of these things!

00:01:26.500 --> 00:01:28.324
GUYS! I FOUND SOMETHING!

00:01:28.500 --> 00:01:30.780
Please tell me it explains
how we get home.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:32.056
That's us…

00:01:32.500 --> 00:01:34.732
But this tablet is
thousands of years old!

00:01:35.000 --> 00:01:36.968
Look at the writing underneath.

00:01:37.500 --> 00:01:40.980
When the four strangers awaken…
the last kingdom shall fall.

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:44.068
Wait. We're supposed to
destroy this kingdom?

00:01:44.500 --> 00:01:47.332
YOU HAVE FINALLY FOUND
YOUR HISTORY.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.604
WHO'S THERE?!

00:01:49.000 --> 00:01:51.904
You were not brought here
to save my kingdom.

00:01:52.054 --> 00:01:54.334
YOU WERE BROUGHT HERE
TO END IT.

00:01:54.500 --> 00:01:56.948
Guys… there's another name.

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:00.000
WHO SENT THEM 4,000 YEARS INTO THE PAST?
TO BE CONTINUED…

